From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mathias Fredriksson <mafredri@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:39:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Add SPDX tags to the ISA-L GCM SSE files

The ISA-L crypto files carry Intel's BSD-3-Clause license text but no
SPDX tag, so spdxcheck fails. module/icp allows only Apache-2.0 and
CDDL-1.0, so list the module copies as BSD-3-Clause overrides.

Signed-off-by: Mathias Fredriksson <mafredri@gmail.com>
---
